# Canonical Skill Adapter

This file only exposes the canonical `{{skillName}}` Skill through this tool's
discovery path.

Before acting, read `AGENTS.md` and
`.ai/skills/{{skillName}}/SKILL.md` completely. Follow the canonical Skill,
including its Rules, Context, references, inputs, authorization boundaries, and
validation requirements. Resolve relative references from the canonical Skill
directory. The canonical artifact governs if this adapter ever differs from it.
